content.text:
No critical or high findings. I'll fix the medium and the useful low ones:
- remove two more stray empty files left by a shell redirect;
- strict UUID validation for legacy slugs;
- show only the newest version of each legacy resource;
- clean founder synonym expansions so they can't change the search query's meaning.

The course-audience point needs no change: migration 0092 already forces every course to be partner-only.

